        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/66666053ead15f2d295c8ac6fada67a4.poster.avif?t=1788091598\" width=1166 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/66666053ead15f2d295c8ac6fada67a4.webm?t=1788091598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/66666053ead15f2d295c8ac6fada67a4.mp4?t=1788091598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot and comedy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lonely game developer. Finding yourself in a fantasy world threatened by the <strong>Singularity Dragon</strong>, you have the opportunity to <strong>summon a harem of catgirls</strong>! The problem is that you first need to assemble this harem and make friends with each of the candidates...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/686ea7b21b35e98b1d20e01fc024c00c.webp?t=1788091598\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel with your squad</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>12 cute catgirls</strong>, each of which has its own unique fighting skills and nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;<i><strong>Summon Harem</strong></i>&quot; ability to immediately teleport up to 4 selected <strong>catgirls</strong> from your harem to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create <strong>buildings</strong> and <strong>synergy</strong> of your harem to more effectively explore a dangerous and colorful world inhabited by fairy-tale creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your charisma and courage to pave the way to sensitive hearts and together save the world from destruction!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/0d17ae1b0f5fe328aa76ce717d895265.webp?t=1788091598\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/3414d2c3027f87efad031869e2fb9f55.poster.avif?t=1788091598\" width=1166 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/3414d2c3027f87efad031869e2fb9f55.webm?t=1788091598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/3414d2c3027f87efad031869e2fb9f55.mp4?t=1788091598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/5040b3e2be3b163e038941e46a99502e.poster.avif?t=1788091598\" width=1166 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/5040b3e2be3b163e038941e46a99502e.webm?t=1788091598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/5040b3e2be3b163e038941e46a99502e.mp4?t=1788091598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cool gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locations are full of <strong>activities</strong>and <strong>secrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting <strong>boss battles</strong> where you are not alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny dialogues</strong> with answer options are combined with a <strong>deep plot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have many <strong>abilities</strong> and the ability to improve them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and hardcore achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/c1382cf954f986034aa340d0253f6c88.poster.avif?t=1788091598\" width=1166 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/c1382cf954f986034aa340d0253f6c88.webm?t=1788091598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/c1382cf954f986034aa340d0253f6c88.mp4?t=1788091598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
